  "term": "neuroblastoma",
  "definition": "Neuroblastoma is a cancer that usually develops in early childhood from immature nerve-related cells of the sympathetic nervous system. It most often occurs in the abdomen, can also appear in the chest or neck, and its course can vary widely from spontaneous improvement to fast spread and death.",
